---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Privacy Policy" description="How Trying, Together protects your data: consent-based sharing, no data sales, and one-tap deletion.">
  <section class="wrap narrow">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
    <h1>Your data is yours.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Fertility data is deeply personal. We built Trying, Together so privacy isn’t a setting you have to
      find — it’s the default, enforced by the system itself.
    </p>

    <h2>Our pledge</h2>
    <ul class="pledge">
      <li>Sharing is off by default. Your partner sees only the categories you switch on.</li>
      <li>Access rules are enforced in the database, not just the app UI.</li>
      <li>We never sell your data or share it with advertisers.</li>
      <li>You can export everything, and delete-everything is a real, permanent erase.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>
      The health information you choose to log (cycle, temperature, ovulation tests, mucus, symptoms, and
      habit entries), your account details (name and email), and basic technical data needed to run the
      service. OPK photos are stored in private storage accessible only to you.
    </p>

    <h2>How we use it</h2>
    <p>
      To provide the app: showing your logs, computing predictions, powering consent-based sharing, and —
      if you subscribe to Pro — generating your weekly coaching. We do not use your health data for
      advertising.
    </p>

    <h2>Sharing between partners</h2>
    <p>
      Nothing is shared until you grant consent per category. Revoking consent cuts off access immediately
      on the next load. The server decides what’s visible; the app cannot override it.
    </p>

    <h2>Your controls</h2>
    <p>
      Export your data as a file at any time. Delete your account and all associated data — logs, photos,
      sharing rules, coaching and sessions — with one tap. An optional PIN or biometric lock protects the
      app on your device.
    </p>

    <p class="note muted">
      This page is a plain-language summary. A full legal policy is reviewed by a privacy attorney before
      public launch. Questions? Contact privacy@tryingtogether.app.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .narrow { max-width: 760px; }
  .lede { font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--muted); }
  .pledge { display: grid; gap: 10px; padding-left: 20px; }
  .muted { color: var(--muted); }
  .note { margin-top: 30px; font-size: 0.9rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding-top: 18px; }
</style>
